587				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
588				<p>
589					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
590					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
591				</p>
592				<p>
593					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
594					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
595				</p>
